# semgrepll - Local Semantic Code Search for AI Agents & Developers

<p align="center">
  <a href="https://pypi.org/project/semgrepll/"><img src="https://img.shields.io/pypi/v/semgrepll?style=for-the-badge&color=blue" alt="PyPI"></a>
